Misho's yes (9 Oct): small talk should answer in seconds, and the writer
spends ~3 s reasoning first. CHAT_SMALL_TALK_REASONING_EFFORT (minimal / low /
medium / high) is sent as reasoning_effort for the small-talk model only —
and only when small talk has its own model (CHAT_SMALL_TALK_FINAL_MODEL), so
the ordinary writer is never touched. Unset or unknown: nothing is sent and
nothing changes.

